Runs Scripts/tag-attribution.py on ios-port: files the port added are
"Authored by Claude Code as directed by Brad Nicholas", upstream files it
changed are "Modified by …" with credit to the Downright contributors.
The two PNG icons and two asset-catalog JSON files cannot hold a comment;
GIT-WORKFLOW.md covers them. Sample.md's tag sits after its front matter.

